      "id": "2065323674249408819",
      "text": "CLAUDE JUST KILLED THE $10K AGENCY WEBSITE\n\nThe hard part of building a brand was never the product\n\nIt was looking expensive\n\n•Hiring an agency for a “premium” landing page\n•Waiting 6 weeks for the first draft\n•Paying extra for custom photography\n•Begging a dev to add scroll animations\n•Settling for a template that screams template\n\nNow you stack 3 AI tools and ship it in one evening\n\nClaude Design writes the structure and the code\nNano Banana + GPT Image 2 generate the visuals\nParallax animations make it feel like a $10k build\n\n“Luxury real estate site. Cinematic hero. Lakefront villas. Editorial typography”\n\nThat’s it. That’s the brief\n\nThe result looks like a Swiss agency charged five figures for it\n\nThe gap between a localhost project and a luxury brand just collapsed into a prompt\n\nCheck full breakdown below",
