      "text": "i literally one shotted an entire game \nwith the higgsfield mcp + claude fable 5\n\nin one prompt it made all of the assets and\na complete working version of the game\n\nonly a year ago this still would've taken \nhours of work and a whole team behind it\n\nall i did was: \n\n1. connect the higgsfield mcp to claude\n2. tell claude to create a pixelated Bible game\n\nthat's literally it\nwhat times are we living in? hahaha",
